                <mxCell id="272" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#ffcdd2;strokeColor=#c62828;fontStyle=0;fontSize=13;" value="What goes wrong:&#xa;  A &#39;free&#39; user spent $12 of their $15 budget.&#xa;  Their Redis counter was at key rule/1.&#xa;  After insertion, &#39;free&#39; is now at index 2 → key rule/2.&#xa;  Lyft looks up rule/2 — it does NOT exist yet in Redis.&#xa;  A FRESH counter starts at $0 — the user gets a free reset mid-month!&#xa;&#xa;  This happened live on 2026-07-16 on charts/core-gateway." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="130" width="500" x="50" y="500" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="273" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontStyle=0;fontSize=13;" value="The Rules:&#xa;  ✅ APPEND only — add new plans at the END of the list&#xa;  ❌ NEVER insert in the middle&#xa;  ❌ NEVER delete an entry (comment out body, keep id: stub)&#xa;  ❌ NEVER reorder&#xa;&#xa;Why not use a YAML map (keyed by name)?&#xa;  Helm sorts map keys alphabetically on every render.&#xa;  Inserting &#39;basic&#39; would still shift &#39;enterprise&#39; and &#39;free&#39; — same bug, invisible." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="150" width="450" x="560" y="500" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
